<title>USA: Katonah-Lewisboro UFSD, N.Y., won by Fleet.</title>
<headline>Katonah-Lewisboro UFSD, N.Y., won by Fleet.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities Inc., said it won $12.500 million of Katonah-Lewisboro UFSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.2214 percent.</p>
